<!--
  Based on:
    mvp-demo/third_party/mujoco-3.4.0/model/humanoid/humanoid.xml

  Change:
    Add a compact 3-camera "node" rig (parallel optical axes) for capture/validation.

  Notes:
    - The node cameras follow the same convention as our minimal rig MJCF:
      x: right, y: forward (look direction), z: up; camera forward is +Y in node frame.
    - A simple freejoint "target" body is included so mj_view_3cam_node.py / mj_capture_3cam_node.py
      can run with defaults.
-->

